      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This has to do with the scaling of the bones. I had the same issue.\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/avatar-dynamics-reports-and-feedback/p/1186-phys-bone-paramters-wont-work-correctly-in-some-weird-situations",
